# Datasets & Checkpoints

> Full statistics, per-component breakdowns, and conversion scripts are in
> [`fairseq/data/nova_data/datasets_summary.md`](mdc:fairseq/data/nova_data/datasets_summary.md).

---

## Data Root

| Environment | Base path |
|---|---|
| Local | `/mnt5/noy/SpectralFM/fairseq/data/nova_data/` |
| RunAI | `/storage/noy/SpectralFM/fairseq/data/nova_data/` |

**WAV subdir convention**: each dataset dir contains a `wav/` (or occasionally `wavs/`) subdirectory with the actual `.wav` files.
`load_wav_files_torchaudio` auto-detects both — pass the dataset root, not the `wav/` subdir.

