## Key Datasets for Evaluation

| Dataset | Samples | Best for | `--eval_data_dir` value |
|---|---|---|---|
| `single_channel_100` | 100 | Quick smoke tests | `fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_100` |
| `single_channel_1k` | 1,000 | Fast FE-decoder tests (≤1k split) | `fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_1k` |
| `single_channel_10k` | 22,222 | **Default for decode_fe** (1k+1k split) | `fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_10k` |
| `single_channel_one` | 1,000,000 | Large-scale embedding eval | `fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_one` |
| `multi_channel` | 3,412,476 | Multi-component clustering | `fairseq/data/nova_data/multi_channel` |
| `labeled_data` | 66,024 | Supervised probing / label regression | `fairseq/data/nova_data/labeled_data` |
| `sampled_data` | 22,428 | Diverse component coverage | `fairseq/data/nova_data/sampled_data` |

